    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nFISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 2 OF 2015\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 02nd March, 2015]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of March 06, 2015\n\n1Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)Act, No. 2 of 2015\n\n2\u2014PL 008753\u20142,900 (01/2015)\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 02nd March, 2015]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 36/2014.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCESACT, NO. 2 OF 1996\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Fisheries and AquaticResources (Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 2015.\n\n2.Section 49 of the Fisherise and Aquatic ResourcesAct, No. 2 of 1996 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection(2A) of that section and the substitution therefor of thefollowing subsection:\u2014\n\n\u201c(2A) Any person who contravenes or fails tocomply with the provisions of sections 14A or 14F ofthis Act shall commit an offence and shall onconviction after summary trial before a Magistrate beliable to an imprisonment for a term not exceedingtwo years or to a fine not less than the amountsspecified in Column II of the Schedule hereto whichshall be determined by taking into consideration thelength of the fishing boat specified in correspondingentry in the Column I of the Schedule:\u2014\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nColumn IColumn IILength of a boatFines10.3 to less than 15 meters Rupees 1.5 Million15 to less than 24 metersRupees 5 Million24 to less than 45 metersRupees 75 Million45 to 75 metersRupees 120 Millionmore than 75 metersRupees 150 Million\u201d\n\nAmendment ofsection 49 ofAct, No. 2 of1996.\n\nFisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)Act, No. 2 of 20152"
