    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSRI LANKA ASSOCIATION OFPROFESSIONAL SOCIAL WORKERS(INCORPORATION) ACT, No. 46 OF 2014\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 24th November, 2014]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 11.00Postage : Rs. 50.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of November 28, 2014\n\n1Sri Lanka Association of ProfessionalSocial Workers (Incorporation) Act, No. 46 of 2014\n\n2\u2014PL 006402\u20142,000 (10/2014)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 24th November, 2014]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. (Inc.) 34/2011.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA ASSOCIATION OFPROFESSIONAL SOCIAL WORKERS\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cSri Lanka Association of Professional Social Workers\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Association according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Associationof Professional Social Workers (Incorporation) Act,No. 46 of 2014."
  },
