    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00 Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of November 28, 2014.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 24th November, 2014]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nWELFARE SOCIETY OF THE SCHOOL FOR THE MENTALLY SUBNORMAL CHILD (INCORPORATION (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 45 OF 2014\n\nWelfare Society of the School for the MentallySubnormal Child (Incorporation) (Amendment)Act, No. 45 of 2014\n\n1\n\n2\u2014PL 007248\u20141,950 (05/2013)\n\n[Certified on 24th November, 2014]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. (Inc. 19/2013)\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE WELFARE SOCIETY OF THE SCHOOL FOR THEMENTALLY SUBNORMAL CHILD (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 75 OF 1988\n\nWHEREAS the Welfare Society of the School for theMentally subnormal Child was incorporated by the WelfareSociety of the School for the Mentally subnormal ChildAct, No. 75 of 1988:\n\nAND WHEREAS the Welfare Society of the School for theMentally subnormal Child now wish to change its name to\u201cChitra Lane Welfare Society for Children with SpecialNeeds\u201d:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Welfare Society of the School forthe Mentally subnormal Child, has now applied to have thesaid Act, amended to give effect to such change in its nameand it will be expedient to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Welfare Society of theSchool for the Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation)(Amendment) Act, No. 45 of 2014."
