    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00 Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 24, 2014.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES FILLING OFVACANCIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 37 OF 2014\n\n1Local Authorities Filling of Vacancies(Special Provisions) (Amendment)Act, No. 37 of 2014\n\nShort title anddate ofoperation.\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 3/2014\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES FILLING OF VACANCIES(SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, NO. 30 OF 2013\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Local Authorities Fillingof Vacancies (Special Provisions) (Amendment) Act, No. 37of 2014 and shall come into operation on such date as theMinister may appoint by Order published in the Gazette.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Local Authorities Filling ofVacancies (Special Provisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 is herebyamended by the repeal of the proviso to that section.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of theLocalAuthoritiesFilling ofVacancies(SpecialProvisions) Act,No. 30 of 2013.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\n2Local Authorities Filling of Vacancies(Special Provisions) (Amendment)Act, No. 37 of 2014\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
