    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nURBAN COUNCILS (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 35 OF 2014\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 24, 2014\n\n1Urban Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 35 of 2014\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 03/2014.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE URBAN COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 255)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Urban Councils(Amendment) Act, No. 35 of 2014 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by OrderPublished in the Gazette.\n\n2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 178A of the Urban CouncilsOrdinance (Chapter 255) and shall have effect as section178B of that Ordinance :\u2014\n\n178B. The provisions of the proviso tosection 178A of the Urban Councils Ordinanceas amended by the Local Authorities (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 21 of 2012 shall not beapplicable to any budget or supplementarybudget to be submitted to an Urban Councilconstituted in terms of elections held prior tothe date of coming into operation of LocalAuthorities (Special Provisions) Act, No. 21 of2012 and Local Authorities Elections(Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012respectively.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title anddate ofoperation.\n\nInsertion ofnew section178B in theUrban CouncilsOrdinance(Chapter 255).\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\n\u201cTransitionalprovision.\n\nUrban Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 35 of 20142"
