    "chunk_size_bytes": 2019,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Society of the CeyloneseBrothers of St. Joseph (Amendment) Act, No. 4 of 2013.\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\n\u201cSociety of theCeyloneseBrothers of St.Joseph\u201d and\u201cCeyloneseBrothers of St.Jeseph\u201d to beknown as\u201cSociety of theSri LankanBrothers ofCharity\u201d and \u201cSriLankan Brothersof Charity\u201drespectively.\n\n2Society of the Ceylonese Brothers of St. Joseph(Amendment) Act, No. 4 of 2013\n\n3.(1) All contracts, agreements, certificates or otherinstruments or documents whatsoever made, issued orexecuted prior to the date of the commencement of this Act,by or in favour of the \u201cSociety of the Ceylonese Brothers ofSt. Joseph\u201d shall be deemed on or after date of commencementof this Act, to be, and to have been made, issued or executedby or in favour of the Society of the Sri Lankan Brothers ofCharity.\n\n(2) All suits, actions, appeals and other legal proceedingsinstituted by or against the \u201cSociety of the Ceyloness Brothersof St. Joseph\u201d and pending on the day immediately prior tothe date of the commencement of this Act, shall not abate orbe discontinued, and may be continued or enforced by oragainst the \u201cSociety of the Sri Lankan Brothers of Charity\u201d.\n\n(3) All the rights, liabilities and obligations of the \u201cSocietyof the Ceylonese Brothers of St. Joseph\u201d other than the rights,liabilities and obligations referred to in subsection (1) on theday immediately prior to the date of the commencement ofthis Act, shall be deemed to be the rights, liabilities andobligations of the \u201cSociety of the Sri Lankan Brothers ofCharity\u201d.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nContinuation ofcontracts,agreements,actions, appeals,rights andliabilities &c.\n\nSociety of the Ceylonese Brothers of St. Joseph(Amendment) Act, No. 4 of 20133"
  },
