    "chunk_text": "(f)to do all other acts and things as are incidental orconducive to the attainment and furtherance of theobjects of the Corporation.\n\nGeneral Powersof theCorporation.\n\nOrganization for the Erection of BalanaBuddha Statue (Incorporation) Act, No. 16 of 2012\n\n4\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any General Meeting or at a Special GeneralMeeting, by a majority of not less than one third of themembers present and voting, to make rules not inconsistentwith the provisions of this Act or any other written law for allor any of the following matters:\u2014\n\n(a)the election of the office bearers, their term of office,resignation from, or vacation of, or removal fromoffice and their powers, duties and functions;\n\n(b)the election and the terms of office of members ofthe Committee of Management other than the officebearers, and the powers, duties and functions of themembers of the Committee;\n\n(c)classification of membership and membership fees,admission, withdrawal and expulsion of membersand membership fees;\n\n(d)the administration and management of the propertyof the Corporation, the custody of its funds and themaintenance and audit of its accounts;\n\n(e)the procedure to be followed at any meeting of theCommittee of Management and the quorumtherefore and the conduct of business thereat; and\n\n(f)the mangement of the affairs of the Corporationand the accomplishment of its objects.\n\n(2) Any rule made by the Corporation may be amended,altered, added to or rescinded at a like meeting and in likemanner, as a rule made under subsection (1).\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n5Organization for the Erection of BalanaBuddha Statue (Incorporation) Act, No. 16 of 2012\n\n(3) The members of the Corporation shall be subject tothe rules of the Corporation."
