    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBUDDHASRAVAKA BHIKKU UNIVERSITY(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 15 OF 2012\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 11th July, 2012]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs.12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of July 13, 2012\n\n1 Buddhasravaka Bhikku University (Amendment)Act, No 15 of 2012\n\n2\u2014PL 005804\u2014 4,090 (06/2012)\n\nShort title.\n\n[ Certified on 11th July, 2012]\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE BUDDHASRAVAKA BHIKKU UNIVERSITY ACT,NO. 26 OF 1996\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Buddhasravaka BhikkuUniversity (Amendement) Act, No. 15 of 2012.\n\n2.(1) In the Buddhasravaka Bhikku University Act, No.26 of 1996 (hereinafter referred to as the \"principalenactment\") and in any other written law, there shall besubstituted for the words \" Buddhasravaka BhikkuUniversity\" the words \"Bhikku University of Sri Lanka\".\n\n(2) Every reference to the \"Buddhasravaka BhikkuUniversity\" in any regulation, rule, notice, notification,contract, communication or other document shall be readand construed as a reference respctively, to the \"BhikkuUniversity of Sri Lanka\".\n\n3.Section 4 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014\n\n(1) by the deletion of the word \"and\" inparagraph (q);\n\n(2) by the re-numbering of paragraph (r) asparagraph (t); and\n\n(3) by the addition immediately after paragraph (q)thereof, of the following new paragraphs:\u2013\n\n\"(r) to conduct post-graduate courses for clergystudents which are consistent with theobjects of the University;\n\nGeneralamendment to theBuddhasravakaBhikku UniversityAct, No. 26 of1996.\n\nAmendment ofsection 4 of theprincipalenactment.\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 52/2006.\n\n2 Buddhasravaka Bhikku University (Amendment)Act, No 15 of 2012"
