    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCENSUS (AMENDMENT)ACT, NO. 26 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 06th May, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 2.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of May 06, 2011\n\n1Census (Amendment) Act, No. 26 of 2011\n\n2\u2014PL 005565\u20144,040 (03/2011)\n\n[Certified on 06th of May, 2011]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 4/2010.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CENSUS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 143)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Census (Amendment)Act, No. 26 of 2011.\n\n2.The Census Ordinance (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (4)of section 5, by the substitution for the words \u201cto a fine notexceeding ten thousand rupees\u201d of the words \u201cto a fine notexceeding fifty thousand rupees\u201d.\n\n3.Section 6 of the principal enactment is hereby repealedand the following new section is substituted therefor:\u2014\n\n6. Every District Secretary, shall in additionto the powers, duties and functions exercised,performed or discharged by him within theAdministrative District in respect of which heis appointed, be appointed as theCommissioner of Census in respect of suchDistrict:\n\nProvided that the Minister may where itappears that it is not practicable to appoint theDistrict Secretary as Commissioner of Censusappoint any other person as Commissioner ofCensus for such Administrative District or partthereof, as the case may be.\u201d.\n\n4.Section 21 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014\n\n(a)in subsection (1) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201cor to a fine not exceeding ten\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 5 ofChapter 143.\n\nReplacement ofsection 6 of theprincipalenactment.\u201cDistrictSecretary tobe theCommissionerof Census."
