    "chunk_size_bytes": 2019,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSTRATEGIC DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 12 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 2.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of April 01, 2011\n\n1Strategic Development Projects (Amendment)Act, No. 12 of 2011\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2011]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 21/2011.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE STRATEGIC DEVELOPMENT PROJECTSACT, NO. 14 OF 2008\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Strategic DevelopmentProjects (Amendment) Act, No. 12 of 2011 and shall bedeemed to have come into operation on January 1, 2011.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Strategic Development Projects Act,No. 14 of 2008 is hereby amended by the substitution for allthe words from \u201cto which exemptions\u2019 to the words\u201d begranted :\u201d of the following :\u2014\n\n\u201cto which may be granted from time to time,exemptions either in full or part, from the applicability ofthe provisions of one or more of the enactments specifiedin the Schedule to this Act or such other assistance orfacilitation as may be necessary to attract strategicinvestment, in the national interest.\u201d.\n\n3.The Schedule to the Strategic Development ProjectsAct, No. 14 of 2008 is hereby amended, by the additionimmediately after item 8 of the Schedule, of the following newitems :\u2014\n\n\u201c9.The Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of 2009.\n\n10.The Ports and Airports Development Levy Act,No. 18 of 2011.\u201d.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n2\u2014PL 005584 - 4,090 (03/2011)\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of theStrategicDevelopmentProjects Act, No.14 of 2008.\n\nAmendment ofthe Schedule tothe Act."
